{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10147","headline":"送兖州杜别驾之任 · 李嘉佑","name":"送兖州杜别驾之任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"停车邀别乘，促轸奏胡笳。\n若见楚山暮，因愁浙水赊。\n河堤经浅草，村径历繁花。\n更有堪悲处，梁城春日斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}